messages.content:
{
  "text": "To foster collaboration and respect in our shared workspace, we’ve arranged desks with practical care. Each person has a private corner for personal focus. The shared tray holds frequently used stationery, placed within easy reach for all. Drawing materials are positioned on the window side, where natural light enhances creativity. A clear center area remains unobstructed, allowing smooth exchange of large sheets and collaborative work. This layout balances privacy with teamwork, ensuring everyone feels included and supported. The shared tray, window side, and clear center are key to our thoughtful design."
}
